From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: enable installed upscalers for run and runinprefix

Since the upscaler setup follows the protonfixes conditions, programs
started with the run or runinprefix verb get no upscalers at all. Lutris
uses runinprefix for a second game in a prefix that is already running,
and Lutris 0.5.22 launches the first game on a new prefix with run.

For those verbs, don't download, remove or replace anything, but still
enable the upscalers a previous waitforexitandrun launch installed, if
their files are present and match the tracking file.

Refs: https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/issues/930
---
--- a/__init__.py
+++ b/__init__.py
@@ -48,6 +48,20 @@
     )
 
 
+def check_run_conditions() -> bool:
+    """Determine if a program was started with the run or runinprefix verb.
+
+    Returns:
+        bool: True, if already installed upscaler files may be enabled.
+
+    """
+    return (
+        len(sys.argv) >= 2
+        and 'STEAM_COMPAT_DATA_PATH' in os.environ
+        and sys.argv[1] in {'run', 'runinprefix'}
+    )
+
+
